# World 2, Coral Islands (SPEC 4.1, 11; docs/STYLE-world2.md section 2): the display
# engine. Ctrl+L, W, 4 starts mission 4 (Reef Run) behind its card; its art loads
# from the floppy into the world arena there. Then a flight across the whole
# 4608 px map, right to left, at full speed and high up:
# - the clouds (lines 72-111) at 1/8, the far islands and their strip (120-179)
#   at 1/4, as one block each;
# - the perspective sea (180-207): line 180 + j at (28 + 3 j) / 112 of the camera
#   (expect-scroll pairs a sea line with an empty one: row 0 and row 27 are bare
#   by contract);
# - the terrain strip (208-255) at 1:1, streamed a 16 px column at a time;
# - line 180 shows the haze H (row 0 empty), the sky's last colour.
# (The sea's swell is held at frame 0 for the flight: its own check is tests/w2sea.agk.)
# The same flight is the world's frame budget: no dropped frames, worst <= 85 %.
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x04
wait-serial "AGK world 2 loaded" 525
wait 60
screenshot card
# (the flight is the display engine's, not the jets': skill 2 after the card, where they never come in mission 4; the card above is at skill 3 and says AND JETS)
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x02
wait 30
# (the sea's swell held still, Ctrl+L, S: this test measures the camera's scroll of every layer, the swell is tests/w2sea.agk's)
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x21
wait 30
press fire 2
wait 60
screenshot start
expect-color start 4 180 0xCFE
expect-color start 160 180 0xCFE
expect-color start 315 180 0xCFE
press up 80
hold left
wait 60
expect-scroll 0 74 319 108 136 3/8
expect-scroll 0 124 319 176 136 3/4
expect-scroll 0 180 319 181 136 93/112
expect-scroll 0 206 319 207 136 318/112
expect-scroll 0 212 319 252 136 3
screenshot fly1
wait 250
screenshot fly2
wait 250
screenshot fly3
wait 250
screenshot fly4
wait 300
screenshot west
release
expect-serial "AGK start world=2 mission=4"
expect-serial "AGK world=2 mission=4"
expect-serial "world2 copper_used=\d+ copper_max=\d+"
expect-no-serial "ERR|missing"
expect-no-dropped-frames
expect-max-load 85
expect-min-chip-free 96
